### ===== CONDOMINIUM =====
# @name listCondominium
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/condominium
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Serach by id
# @name searchCondominium
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/condominium/9
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Insert
