### Update
# @name updateCondominium
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/condominium/7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bela Vista",
  "cnpj": "12345678910124",
  "amount_blocks": 4,
  "amount_apartments": 160,
